<title>LATVIA: STRUZHANI PEAT SHARES BLOCKED AHEAD OF MEETING.</title>
<headline>STRUZHANI PEAT SHARES BLOCKED AHEAD OF MEETING.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most of the shares in the Struzhani peat plant were blocked ahead of a shareholder meeting on July 11, the central depository said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Of 454,431 shares in issue, a total 409,349 shares have been blocked, the central depository said in a statement.</p>
<p>The largest shareholder is a private individual with 59.85 oercent while Baltijas Tranzitu Bank has 5.13 percent and the privatisation agency one percent.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
